window.products.push({"id":149352,"name":"Dishwasher Magnet Cover Decorative Dishwasher Covers for The Front Hummingbird and Sunflower Kitchen Dishwasher Cover Dishwasher Decal Sticker Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815G9gtrhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you have an old dented dishwasher that drives you crazy? Want to make it looks BRAND NEW? Add your favorite image to a cover. Coat your kitchen in a color you love with our favorite paint picks. Dishwasher Covers allow you to easily transform your kitchen as the seasons change. Material: - Self-Adhesive PVC and PET Film Feature: - Heat resistant，Waterproof，Scratch, and Tear Resistant. These Stickers hide scratches, dents, or other unsightly marks. With a smooth surface that is environmentally safe, easy to remove with no sticky residue.. You can do DIY splicing. Quick and economically cheap alternative to old cover. Dishwasher Covers Size: - S - 23 W x 17 H inches;58.5 W x 43 H cm - M - 23 W x 26 H inches;58.5 W x 66 H cm EASY INSTALLATION: Peel it! Stick it! Love it! Simply stick our smudge-proof and fingerprint resistant stainless steel dishwasher panel on the front face of your dishwasher. You can use on your dishwasher as well as on the refrigerator, washing machine and many other appliances!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815G9gtrhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Designfullprint","source_asin":"B08ZN2B3ZS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZN2B3ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZN2B3ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149353,"name":"Large Creamer Pitcher and Milk Frother, Graduated Stainless Steel Pitcher for Coffee and Steamed Milk, Frothing Pitcher for Steaming Milk, 32oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t6vcKkTML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"For anyone aspiring to be a chef or barista, a milk frother pitcher is likely at the top of your list. Unlike bowls, which can be prone to splatters and are difficult to pour out of, pitchers offer maximum containment for any stray milk droplets that may fly up as you froth it for your cappuccino, latte, or other coffee drink. Additionally the slight spout present in most pitchers allows you to maintain greater control as you pour, so you won’t need to worry as much about potential spills. With these pitchers by National Etching, you can easily froth and pour all the milk you need for your favorite coffee drinks, or even just for a simple milk steamer. This pitcher has a series of graduated measurement lines that are etched into the sides for precise and easy measurement thus reducing milk waste. Because the lines are etched and engraved as opposed to printed, they are much easier to clean and care for since the lines won’t fade and they won’t trap milk residue. When you are finished using the pitcher, simply wash it out as you would a glass, either in a sink of water or with a sprayer rinser to ensure that you’ve removed all traces of milk. These pitchers also are equipped with sturdy handles for precise control when pouring frothed milk. The design of this pitcher is sleek and elegant, with a classy stainless steel finish for maximum cleanliness and durability. These pitchers also make great gifts for anyone of a culinary mindset and will outlast the years. These pitchers are manufactured and etched in the United States to ensure top quality and timely shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t6vcKkTML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Etching","source_asin":"B00OJQMGMQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OJQMGMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OJQMGMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149354,"name":"Kwik-Lok Bag Closures White Plastic - 7/8\"L x 1 3/8\"H 1000 Per Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AqfyiMyoL.jpg","description":"These durable bag closures provide a trouble-free method to hold poly bags closed. The hard-wearing plastic tabs deliver easy packaging that is fast to open and equally quick to reclose. These bag closures can be snapped into a dispenser, sold separately for easy access. The colorful clamps can be used to color code expiration dates for perishable foods. The product is secure in the poly bag when using the Kwik-Lok.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AqfyiMyoL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KWIK LOK CORPORATION","source_asin":"B01N9XKYIY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9XKYIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9XKYIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
