window.products.push({"id":149425,"name":"Magnet Dishwasher Cover Decorative for Kitchen,Refrigerator Door Magnetic Stickers,Country Flower Home Cabinet Decor Panel Decal (White Flowers in Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61liIQYUK6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Dishwasher Cover adds a touch of real beauty to your plain looking dishwasher,it’s a Magnet Art, adds style with a cozy feeling. It would be pretty on anything you placed it on, absolutely love it. The Magnetic Stickers hide scratches, dents, or other unsightly marks.With a smooth surface that is environmentally safe, easy to remove with no sticky residue.The cover can be used on dishwasher and fridge door and any metal or stainless home Appliance surface with magnetism. Also,it’s a wonderful gift for friends, elders, and yourself, on Mother’s Day, Christmas, Easter, New Year’s Day, Washington’s birthday and other holidays.When a friend comes as a guest, he will be surprised. Two Sizes for select: S: 23x17inch (58.5x43cm) M: 23X26inch (58.5x66cm) Warm tips: 1.The Cover is a magnetic sticker, pls make sure your dishwasher door is magnetic. 2. Please confirm the size of the dishwasher before buying and whether it is magnetic. 3. Due to the inconsistent calibration of the monitor, the colors on the computer monitor may be slightly different.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61liIQYUK6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSPNT","source_asin":"B09WMXMTDK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMXMTDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMXMTDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149426,"name":"Waterdrop BORPLFTR50 Replacement for Bosch® Ultra Clarity® Pro 11032531, 12033030, 11025825, BORPLFTR55, B36CD50SNS, B36CT80SNS, B36CL80ENS, B36FD50SN","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IktsJ2WsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop WD-F15 refrigerator water filter replacement, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this Waterdrop water filter replacement for Bosch UltraClarity Pro BORPLFTR50 is effective against various materials. [Compatibilty] Compatible with Bosch UltraClarity Pro B36CT80, B36CT80SNS, B36CT80ENS, B36CT81SNS, B36CLSN, B36CL80E, B36CL80SNS, B36CL80ENS, B36CD50, B36CD50SNS, B36CD50SNB, B36FD50SNS, B36IT905NP, B36IT90SNP [Replacement models] Replacement for Bosch UltraClarity Pro BORPLFTR50, BORPLFTR55, REPLFLTR55, REPLFTR50, 12033030, 11032531, 11025825, 12028325, 11041954, 11050659, RA450022 , WFC100MF, WFS200MF [Perfect fit] Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters with advanced industrial automation equipment. We aim to produce 100%-fit refrigerator filters with an exquisite engineering design, unlike inferior replacement filters that have issues with water leakage. Also, we strive to save your precious time by offering tool-free, no-mess refrigerator filter replacement. [Monthly install stickers] The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons, which will vary based on the water conditions. Far from achieving high-standard filtration performance, expired replacement filters might cause pollutants to accumulate. Our complimentary set of monthly install stickers allows you to keep track of the filter’s lifespan. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This water filter replacement for Bosch Ultra Clarity Pro 11032531 effectively filters off something from your water. These include chlorine, taste and odor, and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory. While the impurities are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept, ensuring that your body functions properly. [Premium filter material] Waterdrop uses 100% selected coconut shell carbon block from Sri Lanka. It contains a 2-times-larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, turbidity, taste and odor, rust and sediment tested by the third-party laboratory. Asides, we have selected a food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for being lead-free. [Fresh-tasting water] The 100% coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience. [Be responsible for each product] Each product, or even a small component manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass an extremely high-standard examination to reach the top requirements on the market. These standards don’t end once the filter leaves our factory. Waterdrop will take full responsibility for each filter. Our 24/7 customer service team will provide a water purification solution at any time. [Purified with love] We believe everyone, wherever they are, has the right to drink pure water. We hope to use what benefits us to benefit more people. For every purchase, we donate clean water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IktsJ2WsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B08BFHFM84","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BFHFM84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BFHFM84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
