window.products.push({"id":149469,"name":"1043 Super Wick Humidifier Filter Replacement for Essick Air AirCare Bemis Essick Compatible with EP9500 EP9700 EP9800 EP9R500 EP9R800 821000 826000 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGH1KpwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡【Compatible Models】Fit for all humidifiers required 1043 Wick Filter, compatible models: EP9500, EP9R500, EP9800, EP9R800, EP9700, EP9R700, 826000, 826800, 831000, SS390DWHT, 821000, 821001 and others. To make sure a pleasant buying, you’d better check this 1043 su-per wick humidifier filter in size, model & product number 🏡【Good Quality】Our 1043 super-wick adopts advanced lower density structure technology, which can effectively block particles and hardness minerals in hard water and prevent white powder from entering the indoor a_ir, effectively avoiding the secondary pollution. It matches the original standard and does not cut corners.(The dimentions: 11.7\" x 11\" x 4\"). 🏡【High Performance】- Our 1043 humidifier wick filter does a very good job of filtering out the hardness minerals in the water and prevents a white powder from entering the room air and depositing on everything in sight. Besides, it really helps make the air moist and breathable in dry season. creating a comfortable environment for your home. 🏡【Easy Installation】Install this 1043 Humidifier Filters in minutes, no tools required. Simply run the humidifier out of water. Remove the top, and then there is a frame you need to remove. For best performance, we recommend that you fill the humidifier tank with distilled water and replace the filter every 2-3 months (depending on your specific usage). 🏡【Service and Support】We provide 30-Day 100% money back support, if you have any question with our products, please contact us freely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGH1KpwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERSHOW","source_asin":"B0CDP5CXCB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CDP5CXCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CDP5CXCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149470,"name":"Reusable Filter Cups Compatible with Keurig 1.0 & 2.0 Machines (6-Pack ) - Fits Most Keurig Brewers Golden Mesh Filter (Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uqn4eGA3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEYOND THE PRE-PACKAGED REUSABLE FILTER CUPS You probably know us for our premium water filters. Today you get to learn something new about us... We're serious coffee people. Since premade Reusable Filter Cups just didn't cut it anymore, we searched far and wide for a good reusable cup that would give us the flexibility to brew exactly what each of us liked and would last a long time to boot. After trying countless reusable K-carafes and Reusable Filter Cups (including ones with shapes stamped into them, gold coating, and other gimmicks) and suffering innumerable blowouts, leaks, and clogs, we came to the conclusion that if we wanted it done right, we'd just have to make our own. So here you have it; a solid, functional, reusable hot drink brewing apparatus that is about as close to commercial grade as one can without breaking the bank. NEW POSSIBILITIES A Reusable Filter Cups unlocks a whole new world of possiblities for your Keurig brewer. Where you were once forced to buy new Reusable Filter Cups over and over, and brewing only what some large company thought you'd like to drink, you may now brew literally ANYTHING you want using that same brewer! Enjoy an earthy mug of freshly stove-roasted Blue Mountain coffee, ground right before you brew it. Or a light, contemplative cup of purple-leaf green tea. We recommend keeping one Reusable Filter Cups for tea and one for coffee if you like both. Whatever you're brewing, we would love to hear from you in the review section below. We adore customer feedback! COMPATIBILITY These Keurig compatible reusable will fit most Keurig coffee makers, including Keurig 1.0 and 2.0 models: K31, K40, K44, K45, K50, K60, K66, K70, K77, K100, K135, K140, K300, K350, K400, K450, B31, B40, B44, B50, B60, B66, B70, B77, B100, B140, B200, and any of the following machines: Elite,Classic, Ultra, Special Edition, Ultima","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uqn4eGA3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PDCoffee - K Cups","source_asin":"B082GQ587Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082GQ587Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082GQ587Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
