window.products.push({"id":149475,"name":"Samsung RF31FMESBSR 31 cu. ft. 4-Door Refrigerator with Automatic Sparkling Water Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z8k8UOSqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com REVIEW: The Samsung Stainless Steel 4-Door Refrigerator with Automatic Sparkling Water Dispenser is ideal for large families and those who love to cook and entertain. With a capacity of 31 cubic feet, this modern, four-door refrigerator can hold up to 31 bags of groceries*. It features a built-in sparkling and still water dispenser powered by SodaStream and an in-fridge ice maker that makes up to 10 pounds of ice daily. Separate air flows in the refrigerator and freezer help keep food fresher, while the FlexZone drawer lets you store food at four different temperature zones. And with five shelves, two humidity-controlled crispers, and six door bins, you'll have plenty of room for all your favorite drinks, party platters, and leftovers. Four-door refrigerator can hold up to 31 bags of groceries*. View larger . Features two humidity-controlled crispers, a three-way shelf made of tempered glass, and three 1-gallon door bins. View larger . Enjoy chilled stillor sparkling water. View larger . Enjoy Refreshing Sparkling Water Anytime Great for sparkling water lovers, a built-in dispenser on the outside of the fridge powered by SodaStream delivers chilled sparkling or still water. This convenient feature saves you money and creates less waste than buying bottled sparkling water. The dispenser also produces your choice of crushed or cubed ice. Holds up to 31 Bags of Groceries* Samsung refrigerators are engineered to offer more space inside with the same outside dimensions as traditional models. With a total capacity of 31 cubic feet, the Samsung Stainless Steel 4-Door Refrigerator provides enough space to hold up to 31 bags of groceries. Two humidity-controlled crispers help keep produce fresh, while a three-way shelf made of tempered glass can slide in or flip up to provide more space for tall or oversized items. The refrigerator also includes six clear door bins — three 1-gallon bins on the right door and three regular-size bins on the left. Twin Cooling Plus System For Fresher Produce Samsung's Twin Cooling Plus System helps keep food fresh with two separate airflows for the fridge and freezer. Refrigerator air is kept at higher, near-commercial grade humidity levels to prevent perishable fruits and vegetables from spoiling, while cooler, drier freezer air results in less freezer burn for better-tasting frozen food. Produces up to 10 Pounds of Ice Daily Ideal for parties and barbecues, the refrigerator's Ice Master makes up to 10 pounds of ice per day and can store up to 4.2 pounds. Its space-saving design leaves more room in the refrigerator for your party platters and leftovers. EZ-Open handle. View larger . FlexZone Drawer Keeps Food at Proper Temperature The FlexZone drawer with Smart Divider lets you create adjustable compartments with four separate temperature zones for meat, drinks, snacks, and party dishes. The drawer features an EZ-Open handle that allows you to effortlessly open a fully loaded drawer. Plus, its counter-height location makes it easy for children to retrieve their favorite snacks. Four-Door Design with Stainless Steel Accents The stainless steel refrigerator features a modern design with French doors, a counter-level FlexZone drawer, and a large pullout freezer. Stainless steel accents on the interior shelving and door bins complement the exterior for a sleek, polished look. Energy-Efficient LED Lighting High-efficiency LED lighting in the fridge and freezer brightens every corner so you can quickly spot what you need. LED lights save space and emit less heat than traditional incandescent bulbs, making them a more energy-efficient choice. To further conserve energy, the CoolTight Door closes with a tight seal and a handy alarm alerts you if the door is left ajar or open too long. The refrigerator is ENERGY STAR rated and CEE Tier 2 listed. It measures 70 by 35-3/4 by 37-7/8 inches (HxWxD including hinges, handles, and doors) and weighs 407.9 pounds. What's in the Box Samsung 4-Door Refrigerator with Automatic Sparkling Water Dispenser. 4-Door Refrigerator with Automatic Sparkling Water Dispenser At a Glance: Holds up to 31 bags of groceries* Holds up to 31 bags of groceries* Built-in dispenser delivers chilled sparkling or still water Built-in dispenser delivers chilled sparkling or still water Twin Cooling Plus System for fresher produce Twin Cooling Plus System for fresher produce FlexZone drawer offers four distinct temperature zones FlexZone drawer offers four distinct temperature zones Ice Master makes up to 10 pounds of ice daily Ice Master makes up to 10 pounds of ice daily Modern design with French doors. View larger . * Grocery comparison based on each cubic foot of usable space equaling one paper bag. Choose the Right Samsung Refrigerator for You 4-Door Refrigerator with Convertible Zone 4-Door Refrigerator with Automatic Sparkling Water Dispenser French Door Refrigerator with FlexZone Drawer French Door Refrigerator with FlexZone Drawer 33-Inch French Door Refrigera","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z8k8UOSqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B00COKDPUQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00COKDPUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00COKDPUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
