window.products.push({"id":149613,"name":"BONECO Aqua Pro 2-in-1 Humidifier Filter A250 , White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EnBxxSVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The A250 aqua pro 2-in-1 water filter is the newest BONECO innovation. This filter not only significantly reduces water hardness, but also acts as a water purifier to filter out harmful substances such as copper, lead, mercury as well as unpleasant odors from your water. The A250 aqua pro will last up to 6 months and there is a water test strip included with the filter so each user as a better understanding of how long the filter will last based on their local water hardness. The longer life-cycle of the A250 aqua pro helps keep the maintenance costs down while ensuring the best quality of water is being used in your humidifier. Compatible with all BONECO and AIR-O-SWISS ultrasonic humidifiers with the exception of the 7146 travel humidifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EnBxxSVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONECO","source_asin":"B073WJQ1L6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WJQ1L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WJQ1L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149614,"name":"Futuro Futuro Europe 48 Inch Island-mount Range Hood, Contemporary Stainless Steel Design, LED, Ultra-Quiet, with Blower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2995.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NtUNlRuCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Futuro Futuro’s 48-Inch Europe Island Range Hood features high performance with a distinct style perfect for any kitchen with a modern design. The Europe series is made with the highest grade of Stainless Steel and a special fingerprint free finish so your hood will always be beautiful. This hood is perfect for people who need the best and love making an impression. With a special fingerprint free finish and the highest grade of Stainless Steel, AISI 304, the Europe Island Range hood is one of Futuro Futuro’s most premium products. Due to a higher percentage of Chromium than normal, the AISI 304 standard has an especially high resistance to both rust and corrosion making it perfect for kitchen hoods. Between the special fingerprint free finish and high grade Stainless Steel The Europe series is a low maintenance hood that will always shine. Futuro Futuro developed a patented sound-absorbing chamber that always keeps your kitchen quiet, exceeding the expectations of even professional chefs. With an Internal Whisper tangential blower, you’ll have the power of a commercial kitchen hood without all the noise. This will keep your kitchen clean no matter what you’re cooking. For easy access to all of the available features a simple illuminated electronic control panel was implemented into every hood. Whether you need to set a 15-minute delayed shut off timer or regularly change between the four adjustable speeds, it’s all only a button away. The Europe series uses a cutting edge perimeter suction system that is extremely effective. It directs the airflow outward to the collector slots around the perimeter of the hood and into a concealed filter. The filters are easily accessible through a hatch that opens up. This makes it easy to clean the dishwasher safe filters. The control panel will even send you a reminder when it’s time to clean them out. The Europe Island Range Hood has four LED lights in each corner to give a balanced illumination to your kitchen island.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NtUNlRuCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Futuro Futuro","source_asin":"B009X0PW2O","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009X0PW2O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B009X0PW2O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
