window.products.push({"id":149693,"name":"Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher With Integrated Thermometer, 20oz/600ml Milk Coffee Cappuccino Latte Art Frothing Pitcher Barista Milk Jug Cup, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVuHQuJLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a new and uniquely designed milk frothing pitcher that does not require the use of a stick thermometer. By integrating the temperature measurement within the jug, we have removed the risk of cross-contamination of milk types and hygiene-related issues due to the reinsertion of unclean stick thermometers. The milk frothing pitcher has benefits for:●Professional and part-time baristas●Commercial kitchens●Domestic home users●Office and workplace kitchens●Barista training collegesIn the making of any milk-based drink, including coffee, one of the key elements is achieving the optimum milk temperature. This is difficult for baristas and domestic users to achieve every time without reliable tools, and often coffee is made too hot or too cold. We have developed a product that solves this problem and assists baristas and home consumers to achieve the right temperature each time. FEATURES: ●Quality stainless steel 304 Use for long life.Use in home, office or commercial situations. ●Ergonomic handle Comfort for constant use by hospitality users.Colour silicon grommet for easy identification of milk type in each jug (3 per jug). ●Large liquid crystal temperature display Consistency in temperature & no calibration required.Colour association for training (green identifier for each temperature step makes it easy to identify when the target temperature has been reached).No cross-contamination (stick thermometer not required).Increased productivity due to increased speed.Lower customer drink returns.Lower OH&S and consumer safety risk. ●Embedded dishwasher-safe temperature thermometer on two sides Easily visible and suitable for both left and right handed users.Highly durable surface and safe for all dishwashers. Package include: Milk Frothing Pitcher With Integrated Thermometer×1 Rubber×3colors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVuHQuJLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wolltoll","source_asin":"B07M7WTZS1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M7WTZS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M7WTZS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
