window.products.push({"id":149805,"name":"Coffee Filter for Hario V60, Chemex, Osaka carafes and other pour over coffee makers. Stainless Steel Reuseable Cone Dripper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710eOK0rXqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We have worked hard to provide a high quality stainless steel cone coffee filter. This design prevents any grounds from getting in your coffee, while allowing the oils and nutrients to pass through to your cup, ensuring a better tasting cup of coffee. Merica Coffee stands behind this with a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee.  How to use the Merica Coffee Cone Dripper:  Step 1: Place filter in any carafe and fill with your desired amount of coffee grounds. (medium grind will work best)  Step 2: Once you have brought the appropriate amount of water to a boil, remove it from the heat and allow it to stop boiling vigorously.  Step 3: Pour a small amount of water over the coffee grounds to wet them, and wait for about 30 seconds for them to “bloom”, releasing the most desirable coffee elements from the grounds. Step 4: Slowly pour the remaining water over the grounds, using a circular or back-and-forth motion as you pour to ensure an even soaking of the grounds. It should take about three minutes for a 6 once cup of coffee to finish dripping. Step 5: Once the filter has finished dripping remove it to enjoy you coffee.  Thank you for considering Merica Coffee Filters. We think you will like them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710eOK0rXqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merica Coffee Company","source_asin":"B01HU155JC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HU155JC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HU155JC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
