window.products.push({"id":149865,"name":"GOLDTONE Reusable 4-Cup Nylon Mesh Coffee Filter, 2 Size Paperless Cone (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KaojFaPgL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY & ECONOMICAL: These refillable coffee filters fit any machine that takes a #2 cone filter, and should have a permanent place in your kitchen. Use them to brew your morning pot as a simple way to reduce waste. Coffee filter replacements usually end up in landfills but with these filtration devices, every cup of coffee will be a little bit better for the environment. NICE GIFT FOR MEN & WOMEN: If you’re making a gift set for a gourmet coffee lover in your life, this drip filter tool is an excellent idea. It produces delicious commercial-quality coffee with nothing more than hot water and your favorite beans. It allows more flavor to come through compared to paper filters. It’s a must-have accessory for any coffee-themed gift basket! BPA-FREE: A high percentage of paper coffee filters use toxic chlorine during the manufacturing process. While a small number of unbleached filters are available on the market, reusable filters are an even better option since they don’t lead to deforestation or pollution. This round, conical-shaped filter is BPA-free and does not contain any harmful chemicals. MESS FREE & EASY TO CLEAN: This fine coffee strainer is a great addition to any coffee bar, kitchen, or office. It’s dishwasher safe, so it’s super easy to clean. We use a high-quality nylon mesh screen material that holds up well to repeated coffee brewing in your coffee maker. Its black color ensures it always looks in tip-top shape. Add this amazing product to your filtered coffee kit today! GOLDTONE COFFEE PRODUCTS: At GoldTone, we’re proud to offer equipment and accessories that are made in the United States. Coffee drinkers can rest assured that they are supporting an American company when they purchase our environmentally-friendly products. Our filters are precision crafted using the best-woven mesh available, so you can be sure you’re buying a quality item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KaojFaPgL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoldTone","source_asin":"B076HW2CYP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076HW2CYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B076HW2CYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
