window.products.push({"id":149896,"name":"PANSHA Door Knob Cover Grey with Bird Embroidered 2 PCS, Soft Velvet Wall Protector, Decorative Door Knob Cushion Not to Dent Applicances","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S91L9bXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product name: Round Door Knob Covers Color: Grey with bird embroidered Commodity size: approx. 3.5 inches across Product weight: approx. 1 oz Main material: Velvet Cloth, Foam Pad Product packaging: OPP bag We make door knob covers that are soft and don't look like hardware but has mutlifunction. We have come up with this Regular Size Fits All door knob protector for wall :- Easy to Install in seconds with no tools , Easy to Clean with water and soap. Fit on most standard popular sizes round door knobs. Comfortable, Soft to the touch! The best decorative, functional and effective solution that serves a great need. It's perfect for every household to decorate their round door handles as well as to care for any objects behind the doors. Made of very soft velvet cloth, won't ball up, won't fade, won't deform, environmentally friendly, durable. Less Cold and Less Hot to the touch - No more burning when touching outdoor door knobs. Withstands extreme hot and cold temperatures. Stretch to install by hand only. Decorative, bring fun to life! Velvet Cloth material, durable and elastic, set on the door knob, with a cute little bird embroidered, can be used to adsorb shock on the wall, anti-vibration and reduce noise, thus protecting the wall. Satisfaction Guaranteed or full money back. If you are unhappy with our product simply let us know and we will sort it out ASAP. We are committed to provide the best customer service. Due to different light and camera equipment, there may be slight color difference between the actual product and the photo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S91L9bXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PANSHA","source_asin":"B09WHX3KQ6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WHX3KQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WHX3KQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149897,"name":"24 Pack WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet Kit by Beaquicy - Replacement for G-E Hot-point Ken-more Range - Replaces 247410, AP2622260, EAP241358,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+OBcZMwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟐𝟒 𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲】-- WB2K101 Rubber Gate Feet is for ranges, can keep your grate level so that your pan can also be level and provide even cooking. Avoid the potential for cookware tipping over due to unstable grate placement. Each support shelf foot of the grate needs to be installed so that your grate remains balanced. Worn or missing burner feet can cause scratches on your gas hob and spoil the look of your hob. The package includes 24 x Rubber Grate Feet. There is a 1mm vent hole in the center of the footpad. The shaft diameter is 4.5 mm/0.18 inch. The shaft length is 5.5 mm/0.22 inches, suitable for 3/16\" holes. Zoom in slightly to ensure a better fit. 【𝑹𝑼𝑩𝑩𝑬𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】-- The WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet is made from high-quality, durable, heat-resistant rubber material. The high quality material makes the WB2K101 Rubber Feet better able to withstand high temperatures and less likely to melt and emit a pungent smell due to high temperatures. The Range Grate Rubber Feet have been manufactured with a slightly enlarged shaft to allow for a better fit into the grate and to prevent easy dislodgement, and require a little force to insert the rubber feet into the grate. ➤A pack of 24 Rubber Feet will satisfy your need for multiple replacements and is also less expensive than buying multiple smaller packs. 【𝑺𝑼𝑰𝑻𝑨𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳𝑺】-- WB2K101 Burner Grate Rubber Feet replacement for G-E, Ken-more, Hot-point Range. Replace: 247410, AP2622260, EAP241358, PS241358. ➤24 Pack WB2K101 Rubber Feet compatible: EGR3001EH3SS, P2B918DEM4BB, JGBP32WEJ1WW, JGBP35WEA5WW, JGBP33DEM1WW, JGB650DEF2BB, JGB650DEF1BB, JGB650SEF3SS, PGB910SEM1SS, PGB910SEM2SS, PGB910SEM3SS, PGB910SEM4SS, JGB750EEF1ES, JGB750EEF2ES, JGB750EEF3ES, JGB920SEC3SS, JGB285DET2BB, PGB908SEM2SS, JGBP85BEB5BB, JGBP86DEM1BB, JGBP87SEM3SS, JGBP88SEL3SS, JGBP89SEM2SS, JGBS23DEM1SS, PGB918SEM2SS, PGB918SEM3SS, PGB918SEM4SS, 36275701002, 36275702001, 36275707001, 36275708001, RGB845BEC3WH, RGB845WEC1WW, RGB845WEC3WW, etc. 【𝟔𝟎 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】-- The 24 Pack WB2K101 Rubber Gate Feet support 60 DAYS return and exchange. ➤The worn out burner feet pads will not only scratch the surface of your hob and spoil the aesthetics of your cooktop. It can also leave your grate without proper leveling, causing pots to tilt and cook unevenly, resulting in unsafe cooking. Our range grate rubber feet can protect your range, tabilize your pans, keep your grates and pans level even for cooking. If your rubber grille feet are worn or missing, it could cause the pan to tilt, you need to replace it. The pack of 24 is enough to fit one of each foot on each grate. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】-- The installation of WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet is very simple and does not require any tools, just work gloves to protect your hands. Turn the grate over, pop out the old feet and put the new parts in place. It is recommended to apply High Temp Silicone or Adhesive to the Rubber Pads. This simple operation can solve the problem that the grate is not properly leveled and the pan is not evenly tilted. NOTE: When installing, wait until the surface of the cooktop and grate has cooled down to avoid burns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+OBcZMwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B085C3LVLP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085C3LVLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B085C3LVLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
