window.products.push({"id":149940,"name":"4681EA2001T Washer Drain Pump, OEM Drain Pump 4681EA2001T Compatible with LG Kenmore Washers Replaces Part Numbers AP5328388, 4681EA1007G, 2003273, 46","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VfbBqos9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The lg washing machine drain pump compatible with most top brands like LG, Kenmore and replaces part numbers 2003273, 4681EA1007D, 4681EA1007G, 4681EA2001D, 4681EA2001N, 4681EA2001T, 4681EA2001U, AP5328388, PS3579318. Replaces Part Numbers: 4681EA2001T washer drain pump replaces numbers 2003273, 4681EA1007D, 4681EA1007G, 4681EA2001D, 4681EA2001N, 4681EA2001U, AP5328388, PS3579318 and EAP3579318. The lg wm2301hr drain pump is made of premium quality material, non OEM parts but meets OEM. Size:Original version Packaging includes: 1 pcs Washer Pump 4681EA2001T Note: To make this wm2501hwa drain pump you will need a Phillips screwdriver, a small flat-blade screwdriver, a pair of needle nose pliers, and a pair of slip-joint pliers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VfbBqos9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rain King","source_asin":"B0928L6KQZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928L6KQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928L6KQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":149941,"name":"Indoor Outdoor Temperature Humidity Meter TH804A Hygrometer Gauge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rh4g2+YFL._SL1290_.jpg","description":"This is a great thermometer hygrometer combination, in addition it can measure the outdoor temperature with a temperature sensor on a 5 ft cable.Most experts recommend an indoors air humidity level between 40 and 60% as most comfortable. Too dry air can strain the respiratory tract, while high humidity levels promote the growth of mold and germs in the walls.Many people use humidifiers during the dry winter months. But does your humidifier work right? Does it provide enough moisture, or too much? Measure it using the Humidity Meter TH804A!This meter will allow you to check the humidity level and temperature quickly. The sensor is located at the lower edge of the meter, for best air circulation and fast readings. Place the meter in a room and after 3-5 minutes it will give you a stable reading of the current conditions. You then can use the readings to adjust the humidifier. If the meter reads 'dry' it might be good to switch it on, if it reads 'wet' you should switch it off to avoid mold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rh4g2+YFL._SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Judastice","source_asin":"B004F8CS44","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004F8CS44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B004F8CS44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
