window.products.push({"id":149975,"name":"WP2260518W 2260518W Water Filter Cap 2260502W Kenmore Refrigerator AP6006884 PS11739972 KSCS25INSS00 ED2FHEXSS00 ED2VHEXVQ01 ED5FHEXVS01 ED5VHEXVB04 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bv7fx0DLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Water Filter Cap Wp2260518w For Refrigerators - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers 2260518W, AP6006884, 2260502W, 1058149, PS11739972, WP2260518WVP. Refrigerator Replacement Wp2260518w Filter Cap is compatible with Whirlpool, Amana, Inglis, Jenn-Air, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Maytag appliances. It is designed to fit over the water filter housing and keep the water filter in place. It fits dozens of models and can be easily installed. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. If you need to replace your old water filter cap, this replacement cap is a great option to consider. Kenmore Wp2260518w Refrigerator Water Filter Cap will help if your appliance part is broken or missing. Make sure your fridge is unplugged before this repair. 💡 Wp2260518w Water Filter Cap is made of high-quality materials, which ensures that it is durable and long-lasting. If your previous water filter cap is cracked, damaged, or missing, Whirlpool Wp2260518w Replacement Cap can be used to ensure that the water filter is securely in place and functioning properly. WP2260518W 2260518W Water Filter Cap meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How often should I replace the water filter cap? The water filter cap does not need to be replaced on a regular basis as long as it is not damaged or broken. However, if the water filter cap becomes cracked, damaged, or broken, it should be replaced immediately. A damaged cap can cause the water filter to become loose or fall out of place, which can affect the quality and safety of the water dispensed from the refrigerator. 💡 Will replacing the refrigerator water filter cap improve water quality? Replacing the refrigerator water filter cap will not directly improve water quality. The 2260518W Water Filter Cap is designed to keep the water filter securely in place, which ensures that the water passing through the filter is properly filtered and safe to drink. Over time, the water filter cap may become damaged or worn, which can cause the water filter to become loose or fall out of place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bv7fx0DLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07NH9HJL9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-149975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NH9HJL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NH9HJL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
